  "description": "Dating is strictly banned at the Air Force Academy, and Senior Cadet Lim Cheong-ha enforces the rules with an iron fist. But her strictly disciplined life crashes down when a mysterious cadet drops a bizarre confession: **\"I won't kill you in this life.\"**\n\nApparently, they were lovers in a past life—and he was the one who ended her. Cheong-ha has only one response to his dramatic, angst-ridden prophecy: *Shut up and just confess already, you lunatic. Before I make sure you die first.*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70436988/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%84%88%EC%9D%98-%EC%9C%99%EB%A7%A8%EC%97%90%EA%B2%8C/4990)",
